  conducts archimate:association, archimate:specialization, archimate:flow, archimate:triggering, archimate:influence, archimate:access, archimate:uses, archimate:serving, archimate:realization, archimate:assignment, archimate:aggregation, child, c4:association, c4:realization, c4:uses, c4:sendsto, c4:dependson, c4:includes, infra:flow, infra:deploys, infra:pushes, infra:reads, infra:signs
  same-level both
}

